},
{
"k": "31011",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "{DefensiveA}[weak]What's it look like?"
},
{
"k": "31012",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "{PainA}[painful grunt]"
},
{
"k": "31013",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[gasping from pain]She said she'd… had enough."
},
{
"k": "31014",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]She couldn't live with what she'd done."
},
{
"k": "31015",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You used her!"
},
{
"k": "31016",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're a liar."
},
{
"k": "31017",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; accusing]It's not her fault if you used her to keep those girls under your thumb!"
},
{
"k": "31018",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]It was her idea? What do you mean?"
},
{
"k": "31019",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]You're a fucking liar!"
},
{
"k": "31020",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Believe what you want then."
},
{
"k": "31021",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "This was our place, Bigby. [beat]She was in it from the beginning."
},
{
"k": "31022",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[weak]It all starts the same way for all of us."
},
{
"k": "31023",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]We needed a way to make a livin'. Figured this was as good as any."
},
{
"k": "31024",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[weak; slight chuckle]You've got it all wrong…"
},
{
"k": "31025",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Like anyone could ever tell Vivian what to do."
},
{
"k": "31026",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "\"Discretion is our guarantee\"..."
},
{
"k": "31027",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain] You know she came up with that?  It was her idea."
},
{
"k": "31028",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[weak]It started as part of the gimmick, right."
},
{
"k": "31029",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[weak]She always had good ideas, that one."
},
{
"k": "31030",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You won't get my sympathy."
},
{
"k": "31031",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why'd you kill Faith and Lily?"
},
{
"k": "31032",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I wouldn't respect you if you did."
},
{
"k": "31033",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I don't feel sorry for you, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "31034",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why'd you do it, Georgie? Why'd you kill those women?"
},
{
"k": "31035",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I did what I had to."
},
{
"k": "31036",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]We don't always get a choice, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "31037",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[cold]You're a dead man, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "31038",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I know... Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "31039",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[groans in intense pain]"
},
{
"k": "31040",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Look for a bright blue sign. You can't miss it."
},
{
"k": "31041",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Really fuck him up for me, alright?"
},
{
"k": "31042",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You know the bastard deserves it."
},
{
"k": "31043",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Give 'im hell."
},
{
"k": "31044",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Make a promise to a dying man."
},
{
"k": "31045",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He'll get it worse than you."
},
{
"k": "31046",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't worry about him."
},
{
"k": "31047",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why do you care?"
},
{
"k": "31048",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]So just tell me."
},
{
"k": "31049",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "{DefensiveA}[weak] No."
},
{
"k": "31050",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "{AngryA}Didn't fuckin' matter what I said."
},
{
"k": "31051",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[dying] How badly did you fuck up the Crooked Man?"
},
{
"k": "31052",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]That bastard."
},
{
"k": "31053",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I hope you gave 'im Hell."
},
{
"k": "31054",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I killed him. The Crooked Man is dead."
},
{
"k": "31055",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He's gonna have it worse. Don't worry."
},
{
"k": "31056",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He'll pay for his crimes."
},
{
"k": "31057",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Or at least a piece of it."
},
{
"k": "31058",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[flat]Don't worry about the Crooked Man."
},
{
"k": "31059",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I won't promise you anything."
},
{
"k": "31060",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Figures."
},
{
"k": "31061",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Playin' it close to the chest. I get it."
},
{
"k": "31062",
"who": "BIGBY",
