"k": "31069",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[determined]Aren't I responsible too?"
},
{
"k": "31070",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why do I deserve mercy when he didn't?"
},
{
"k": "31071",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He was using you."
},
{
"k": "31072",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "This isn't mercy."
},
{
"k": "31073",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It wasn't your fault. He's the one-"
},
{
"k": "31074",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[indignant]Him?"
},
{
"k": "31075",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We started this together."
},
{
"k": "31076",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[to herself]Why do I have to live with this?"
},
{
"k": "31077",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why do I get to live?"
},
{
"k": "31078",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He was using you. Your ribbon. It's not-"
},
{
"k": "31079",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[finishing his sentence; indignant]Not my fault? [beat] Why not?"
},
{
"k": "31080",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Vivian, this isn't mercy."
},
{
"k": "31081",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "What would you call that?"
},
{
"k": "31082",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm just as guilty as he is. But you're going to let me live."
},
{
"k": "31083",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You know it's my ribbon that's doing this."
},
{
"k": "31084",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "And I shouldn't have- [stops herself]"
},
{
"k": "31085",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; the cops showed up]Shit."
},
{
"k": "31086",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Hello, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "31087",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[snaps]Vivian!"
},
{
"k": "31088",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's what we do."
},
{
"k": "31089",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're wearing one yourself!"
},
{
"k": "31090",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[to Georgie]What is your problem?"
},
{
"k": "31091",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[menacing; angry]You think it's so fuckin' obvious.[mocking] Georgie's the bad guy! It's all his fucking fault!"
},
{
"k": "31092",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]That little doe-eyed bitch knows."
},
{
"k": "31093",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Ha! [cough]"
},
{
"k": "31094",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]I told you!"
},
{
"k": "31095",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Leave her out of this."
},
{
"k": "31096",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[forceful]Hey! Leave her out of this, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "31097",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "She's involved?"
},
{
"k": "31098",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Wait. How is she involved in all this?"
},
{
"k": "31099",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; in pain]Oh, she's been a part of this from the beginning."
},
{
"k": "31100",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; in pain]Oh, she's been a part of this from the beginning. Tell him, Vivian."
},
{
"k": "31101",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Doin' what you have to."
},
{
"k": "31102",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Could you sacrifice her life… for their freedom."
},
{
"k": "31103",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[shaking; \"I dare you\"] So do it."
},
{
"k": "31104",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[betrayed; getting angry]You want him to kill me?!"
},
{
"k": "31105",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's just the way it goes."
},
{
"k": "31106",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[almost to himself]It's time you learned… People like us don't get to choose our fate. It's those crooks, the men in that room back there, they decide it for us. [beat] I'm just playin' my part."
},
{
"k": "31107",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We fucked up! Both of us!"
},
{
"k": "31108",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Look, I'm just--"
},
{
"k": "31109",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You didn't have to do anything!"
},
{
"k": "31110",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Don't touch me!"
},
{
"k": "31111",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]But you know what?"
},
{
"k": "31112",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[cold]Not the first time you got it  wrong."
},
{
"k": "31113",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[sad]It doesn't work that way."
},
{
"k": "31114",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in shock]Why'd you have to do that, Vivian?"
},
{
"k": "31115",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You happy now?"
},
{
"k": "31116",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Your turn."
},
{
"k": "31117",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[cold]Are you happy now? Is this what you wanted?"
},
{
"k": "31118",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Anything else you want to tell me? More co-conspirators I should know about?"
},
{
"k": "31119",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[threatening] Alright, Georgie. Your turn."
},
{
"k": "31120",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He'll be there... the fucking asshole."
},
{
"k": "31121",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You know that."
},
{
"k": "31122",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[worried]Georgie…"
},
{
"k": "31123",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Look, I know he made a few mistakes. [guilty]We all have."
},
{
"k": "31124",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Fuck's sake."
},
{
"k": "31125",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[menacing]Here's the deal, Wolf."
},
{
"k": "31126",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[challenging]But you know what? [beat]You can do what you want to me."
},
{
"k": "31127",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Stop it."
},
{
"k": "31128",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Doesn't matter what we do."
},
{
"k": "31129",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We're lucky if we get to watch."
},
{
"k": "31130",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[betrayed]I thought you were better than that."
},
{
"k": "31131",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry] Yeah."
},
{
"k": "31132",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Those were YOUR ribbons?"
},
{
"k": "31133",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You've been helping him?"
},
{
"k": "31134",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "How could you?"
},
{
"k": "31135",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's true."
},
{
"k": "31136",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Wait, those were your ribbons? You're in on this?"
},
{
"k": "31137",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Wait, so you've been helping this asshole?"
},
{
"k": "31138",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[defiant]Yes."
},
{
"k": "31139",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]How could you do this?"
},
{
"k": "31140",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[ashamed]I know."
},
{
"k": "31141",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "To survive."
},
{
"k": "31142",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I-"
},
{
"k": "31143",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You break the curse, and they're all free."
},
{
"k": "31144",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; sad]Why are you doing this?"
},
{
"k": "31145",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Poor girl had a terrible curse upon her neck. A ribbon."
},
{
"k": "31146",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; ignoring her] 'Cause I don't give a shit!"
},
{
"k": "31147",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[cold]Well you were wrong, weren't you? I'm just a crook like the rest of 'em."
},
{
"k": "31148",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm just playin' my part."
},
{
"k": "31149",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[painful angry groan]"
},
{
"k": "31150",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[sharp pain; wince]"
},
{
"k": "31151",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But you can't do it, can you? Sacrifice her life… for their freedom."
},
{
"k": "31152",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "She may not be innocent, but look at her. We all know you have a soft spot for girls like her."
},
{
"k": "31153",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Poor girl had a terrible curse upon her neck in the form of a pretty purple ribbon."
},
{
"k": "31154",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm- [stops herself; not sure what to say]"
},
{
"k": "31155",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "She may not be innocent in all this, but we all know you have a weakness for girls like her."
},
{
"k": "31156",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]And now you wanna act like I'm the only one to blame?"
},
{
"k": "31157",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't feel too bad for her, Bigby. She knew what she was doin'."
},
{
"k": "31158",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Can't run a zoo if the animals won't stay put, can you?"
},
{
"k": "31159",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You didn't have to do anything."
},
{
"k": "31160",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[painful breath]"
},
{
"k": "31161",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Like Hell I am!"
},
{
"k": "31162",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]The Crooked Man gave the order!  He told me to kill them! And then he fuckin' sold me out!"
},
{
"k": "31163",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "So he said, \"Take care of it, Georgie\". What was I supposed to do?"
},
{
"k": "31164",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're still responsible!"
},
{
"k": "31165",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "That's not my problem."
},
{
"k": "31166",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're still the one who pulled the trigger! Nobody held your hand and made you go through with it."
},
{
"k": "31167",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Oh, I get it. When a pretty little girl shows up at your door wantin' help, you've got all the time in the world."
},
{
"k": "31168",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]But when I've got somethin' to say it's \"not your problem\"."
},
{
"k": "31169",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[bitter laugh; painful]"
},
{
"k": "31170",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Well, fuck you!"
},
{
"k": "31171",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't you fuckin' tell me what to do!"
},
{
"k": "31172",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[calm down]Georgie, please..."
},
{
"k": "31173",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "That's not what I meant. I was just trying to--"
},
{
"k": "31174",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "And I'm telling you to fuck off!"
},
{
"k": "31175",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]I know what you're tryin' to do!"
},
{
"k": "31176",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[warning]No..."
},
{
"k": "31177",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; sarcastic]You remove hers ... and the spell's broken.  They're all free!"
},
{
"k": "31178",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I won't kill her."
},
{
"k": "31179",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I told you... sometimes all your options are shit."
},
{
"k": "31180",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Stop it!"
},
{
"k": "31181",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Why does he get to decide?"
},
{
"k": "31182",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm not playing this game, Georgie. I won't kill her."
},
{
"k": "31183",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[seething anger]Don't talk about me like I'm not even here."
},
{
"k": "31184",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We'll find another way, she-- she doesn't have to die.  Maybe the witches can--"
},
{
"k": "31185",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Why should you get to decide?"
},
{
"k": "31186",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]So it's up to him?"
},
{
"k": "31187",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
